From 2b44c995e491e77a4727724ba479f5711fe79e98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gus bourg <gus@bourg.net>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 20:18:09 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 12/17] media: amlogic: amvdec: add stateless HEVC decoding

Add HEVC_SLICE decoding with synthesized parameter headers and
request-owned input, capture and reference buffers. Validate CTB
geometry and refuse single-column multi-row pictures and long-term
prediction that cannot be decoded reliably.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-fable-5-1
